{"name": "Cloud Keeper: Shrine of Dal", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"89\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065400/extras/e0b9648bd43c50c6333fc8e6736ded35.avif?t=1786999172\" width=\"1080\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065400/extras/bedc4f3c53bb982370f886be135cf04f.poster.avif?t=1786999172\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065400/extras/bedc4f3c53bb982370f886be135cf04f.webm?t=1786999172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065400/extras/bedc4f3c53bb982370f886be135cf04f.mp4?t=1786999172\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>In a land inspired by Korean folklore, summon cloud companions and fight the hordes of monsters. Collect loot and make offerings in exchange for more clouds and relics to upgrade your cloud army. Fulfill your duty as Cloud Keeper to the moon goddess Dal and stop the spread of destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"89\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065400/extras/5b38f726a3fe3063dd67adf8b7c25834.avif?t=1786999172\" width=\"1080\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065400/extras/90becbb452847494dd8fde5d0804fa7a.poster.avif?t=1786999172\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065400/extras/90becbb452847494dd8fde5d0804fa7a.webm?t=1786999172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065400/extras/90becbb452847494dd8fde5d0804fa7a.mp4?t=1786999172\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight and survive intense battles against formidable bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"89\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065400/extras/bba4af2a2751e23d1e9a26580df200b6.avif?t=1786999172\" width=\"1080\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065400/extras/ee181b943300be31d5dc0466016dbf1a.poster.avif?t=1786999172\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065400/extras/ee181b943300be31d5dc0466016dbf1a.webm?t=1786999172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065400/extras/ee181b943300be31d5dc0466016dbf1a.mp4?t=1786999172\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock multiple characters to play as the Cloud Keeper, each with different abilities to make every run a unique challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"89\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065400/extras/d3275169315babedab3d3f493e4b531e.avif?t=1786999172\" width=\"1080\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://sh